---

We are currently unable to accept members, as the organization is still in its 
founding phase. If you want to be amongst the first to join, you can attend our 
[founding meeting]($link.page('events/zigtoberfest-2026')) and sign up to the 
mailing list here:

```=html
<form method="post" action="https://newsletter.eurozig.eu/subscription/form" class="listmonk-form">
  <input type="hidden" name="nonce">

  <p><input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="E-mail" aria-label="E-mail"></p>
  <p><input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name (optional)" aria-label="Name (optional)"></p>

  <p hidden>
    <input id="aa0d0" type="checkbox" name="l" checked value="aa0d01ac-b4fd-494b-9bef-cce03357cffb">
    <label for="aa0d0">EuroZig</label>
  </p>

  <altcha-widget challengeurl="https://newsletter.eurozig.eu/api/public/captcha/altcha"></altcha-widget>
  <script type="module" src="https://newsletter.eurozig.eu/public/static/altcha.umd.js" async></script>

  <p><input type="submit" value="Subscribe"></p>
</form>
```
\
By signing up to the list, you are agreeing to us storing your name and e-mail address.
